title: Authorizations › New case › Medical records › The Coverage row
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 2, Insurance list, 'Coverage')
intro: Verify checks coverage by itself as soon as the payer, level of care and member ID are in, and again when they change. A coverage problem keeps 'Continue' off, except on a Retro-authorization.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "On step 2, read the 'Coverage' row"
screen sc "Coverage (Insurance list)\nNo button until Verify has answered"
decision dKey "Are the payer, level of care and a member ID of 4 or more letters or digits in?"
process pIdle "Row is optional (dashed box)\n'Verify checks it once the payer, level of care and member ID are in.'"
agent aV "Verify checks coverage with Summit (demo: simulated)\nAbout 1.2 seconds\nRow shows 'Verify is checking coverage with Summit'"
process pRe "Verify runs again by itself when the payer, level of care, the last four of the member ID, or the start date change"
decision dVer "What did Verify find?"
process pDemo "Demo answers are scripted\nMember ID ending 1012: lapsed. Ending 9999: not found.\nEvergreen with Detox: not in network"
process vOk "Done\n'Coverage checked by Verify. Active, service covered, no authorization needed.'\n(Beacon IOP and PHP)"
process vAuth "Done\n'Coverage checked by Verify. Active, service covered, authorization required.'"
process vFix "'Check this'\n'Coverage needs a fix.' then the reason\nFor example 'Coverage lapsed 10/12...'"

click cView "Click 'View checks'"
overlay oView "Coverage checked\nSubtitle: payer name and the verdict\nThe same seven checks as the Eligibility tab"
click cAgain "Click 'Check again'"
process pAgain "The saved answer is cleared and the pop-up closes\nVerify checks again"
click cClose "Click 'Close', the X, or press Escape"
click cOther "Click 'Choose another payer' (only on a fix)"
process pOther "Payer and plan type are cleared\n'Payer and plan' goes back to missing\nCoverage goes back to optional"
decision dRetro "Is the request type 'Retro-authorization'?"
process pBlock "'Continue' is switched off\n'Still needed: Coverage, or another payer'"
process pPass "The fix does not block\nA retro-authorization exists to cover a gap"
goto gElig "Continues in: Eligibility & Benefits › Result"
goto gRows "Continues in: Medical records › Patient and insurance rows"
goto gAgents "Continues in: Agents work › Start the run and watch it"

s1 --> sc --> dKey
dKey -->|No| pIdle
dKey -->|Yes| aV --> dVer
pRe -.-> aV
pDemo -.-> dVer
dVer -->|Cleared| vOk
dVer -->|Authorization needed| vAuth
dVer -->|Problem| vFix
vOk --> cView
vAuth --> cView
vFix --> cView
cView --> oView --> cAgain --> pAgain --> aV
oView --> cClose
oView -.-> gElig
vFix --> cOther --> pOther --> pIdle
vFix --> dRetro
dRetro -->|No| pBlock
dRetro -->|Yes| pPass --> gAgents
pBlock --> cOther
pIdle --> gRows
